proposal = "Replace the obsolete joined-balance carrier in layerx-client/src/px.rs with the gateway account/height/coin-list contract, preserving the exact decimal amounts. Drive the real gateway producer through JSON-RPC into PxEndpoint::balances for bound accounts, zero balances and refusal cases."
