expected = "Durable preparation recovery must decode the stored type-2 call and rebind its disclosure, with no legacy canonical envelope restore or second signing authorization carrier."
proposal = "Migrate prepare/restore_tests.rs alongside the daemon call-bound restoration path. Produce and persist a real prepared call, reopen storage, then assert restored facts and refusals for modified call bytes, digest, tenant and session generation."
