expected = "Committed means verified coverage of the signed receipt by a committed block, which can be later than execution. Product documentation and shared type semantics must agree with the real producer lifecycle."
proposal = "Clarify layerx-types/src/rung.rs to require verified covering-block evidence, preserving the receipt execution height separately, and align receipt consumers and requirement 9262.2 with that distinction."
